wb-mqtt-waterius (1.1.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Service guideline: exit codes 0/1/2/6/7, no restart on 2 and 6, 7 is a success
  * Exit with 6 on any config error, the config is checked against the schema
  * Exit with 7 when no devices are configured, the UI shows "Config Not Valid"
  * Wait for an unavailable MQTT broker instead of exiting

 -- Ekaterina Volkova <ekaterina.volkova@wirenboard.com>  Mon, 09 Nov 2026 13:30:21 +0000

